		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C84248F26B08F67"]
			description: ["Color Film captures the full spectrum of your Minecraft world in vibrant hues. The recipe uses Gold Ingots, Gold Nuggets, Lapis Lazuli, Gunpowder, and Dried Kelp. Developing Color Film requires a sequence of three potions: Awkward Potion, Thick Potion, and Mundane Potion in the crafting grid with the exposed film."]
			id: "227B097A8648E2AD"
