		{
			dependencies: [
				"1C0BD6954927E798"
				"25A9F4A8319B0C7E"
			]
			description: [
				"Once your film roll is full or you are ready to see your photos, the Lightroom transforms exposed film into printed photographs. This workstation simulates the analog darkroom experience with an authentic printing process."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Place your developed film in the Lightroom's film slot along with Photo Paper in the paper slot. Photo Paper is simply regular Paper from vanilla Minecraft. The Lightroom requires a light level of 13 or higher to operate, so place torches, lanterns, or other light sources above the Lightroom to ensure proper illumination."
				""
				"Black and White photos print in 4 seconds and consume 1 Black Dye per print. Color photos take 8 seconds and require all four CMYK dyes: Cyan Dye, Magenta Dye, Yellow Dye, and Black Dye. The Lightroom awards experience points for each successful print."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"For advanced photographers, the Lightroom offers a Chromatic printing mode that separates color channels into individual prints. To activate Chromatic mode, place a Tinted Glass block on top of your Lightroom. This refracts the light and enables the specialized printing process."
				""
				"In Chromatic mode, the Lightroom prints the Red, Green, and Blue channels separately onto Chromatic Sheets rather than final photographs. Each channel uses different dye combinations and takes 6 seconds per pass."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Once you have all three channel prints (R, G, and B), simply hold them in your inventory and they automatically combine into a finished Chromatic photograph."
				""
				"Chromatic printing awards 5 XP when all three channels complete successfully. This method produces the highest quality color prints but requires more resources and time investment. The process is ideal for special photographs you want to preserve at maximum quality."
			]
			id: "55E2D6648D16E3C6"
			rewards: [{
				id: "03CA4BAC01697189"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
